		displayFolder: Month over Month\Previous Month Values
		lineageTag: 9c84d281-e6fd-48c7-9dba-14041db6bf75

	/// Percentage change in Average Rating versus the previous month: (current - previous) / previous. Shows 0% when no previous-month data exists (e.g. for May). Drives the 'Chg % vs PM' labels.
