		displayFolder: Month over Month\Previous Month Values
		lineageTag: e4df2248-d4a0-4882-98a0-61e8d35705bc

	/// Percentage change in ADR versus the previous month: (current - previous) / previous. Shows 0% when no previous-month data exists (e.g. for May). Drives the 'Chg % vs PM' labels.
